        <mxCell id="GJ-ZEg_Tp73-UWNDR1aK-20" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Session in the token will be checked in case of a JWT token only within the /authenticate endpoint.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If the request does not contain basic auth credentials, then a refresh token must be available in the cookie, this must be valid too in addition.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
